:[\"November 4, 2024\",[\"$\",\"$Lc6\",null,{\"id\":\"november-4th-2024\",\"name\":\"November 4, 2024\"}]]}]\n1fb:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lc4\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.anthropic.com/claude/haiku\",\"children\":\"Claude Haiku 3.5\"}],\" is now available on the Claude API as a text-only model.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n1fc:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"november-1st-2024\",\"children\":[\"November 1, 2024\",[\"$\",\"$Lc6\",null,{\"id\":\"november-1st-2024\",\"name\":\"November 1, 2024\"}]]}]\n1fd:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"We’ve added PDF support for use with the new Claude Sonnet 3.5. Read more in \",[\"$\",\"$Lc4\",null,{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/pdf-support\",\"children\":\"PDF support\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"We’ve also added token counting, which allows you to determine the total number of tokens in a Message prior to sending it to Claude. Read more in \",[\"$\",\"$Lc4\",null,{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/token-counting\",\"children\":\"Token counting\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n1fe:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"october-22nd-2024\",\"children\":[\"October 22, 2024\",[\"$\",\"$Lc6\",null,{\"id\":\"october-22nd-2024\",\"name\":\"October 22, 2024\"}]]}]\n1ff:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"We’ve added Anthropic-defined computer use tools to our API for use with the new Claude Sonnet 3.5. Read more in \",[\"$\",\"$Lc4\",null,{\"href\":\"/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/computer-use-tool\",\"children\":\"Computer use tool\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"Claude Sonnet 3.5, our most intelligent model yet, just got an upgrade and is now available on the Claude API. Read more in the \",[\"$\",\"$Lc4\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.anthropic.com/claude/sonnet\",\"children\":\"Claude Sonnet documentation\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n200:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"october-8th-2024\",\"children\":[\"October 8, 2024\",[\"$\",\"$Lc6\",null,{\"id\":\"october-8th-2024\",\"name\":\"October 8, 2024\"}]]}]\n201:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"The Message Batches API is now available in beta. Process large batches of queries asynchronously in the Claude API for 50% less cost. Read more in \",[\"$\",\"$Lc4\",null,{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/batch-processing\",\"children\":\"Batch processing\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"We’ve loosened restrictions on the ordering of \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"user\"}],\"/\",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"assistant\"}],\" turns in our Messages API. Consecutive \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"user\"}],\"/\",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"assistant\"}],\" messages will be combined into a single message instead of erroring, and we no longer require the first input message to be a \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"user\"}],\" message.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"We’ve deprecated the Build and Scale plans in favor of a standard feature suite (formerly referred to as Build), along with additional features that are available through sales. Read more in our \",[\"$\",\"$Lc4\",null,{\"href\":\"https://claude.com/platform/api\",\"children\":\"API pricing information\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n202:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"october-3rd-2024\",\"children\":[\"October 3, 2024\",[\"$\",\"$Lc6\",null,{\"id\":\"october-3rd-2024\",\"name\":\"October 3, 2024\"}]]}]\n203:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"We’ve added the ability to disable parallel tool use in the API. Set \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"disable_parallel_tool_use: true\"}],\" in the \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"tool_choice\"}],\" field to ensure that Claude uses at most one tool. Read more in \",[\"$\",\"$Lc4\",null,{\"href\":\"/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/parallel-tool-use\",\"children\":\"Parallel tool use\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n204:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"september-10th-2024\",\"children\":[\"September 10, 2024\",[\"$\",\"$Lc6\",null,{\"id\":\"september-10th-2024\",\"name\":\"September 10, 2024\"}]]}]\n205:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"We’ve added Workspaces to the \",[\"$\",\"$Lc4\",null,{\"href\":\"https://console.anthropic.com\",\"children\":\"Developer Console\"}],\". Workspaces allow you to set custom spend or rate limits, group API keys, track usage by project, and control access with user roles. Read more in our \",[\"$\",\"$Lc4\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/workspaces\",\"children\":\"Workspaces blog post\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n206:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"september-4th-2024\",\"children\":[\"September 4, 2024\",[\"$\",\"$Lc6\",null,{\"id\":\"september-4th-2024\",\"name\":\"September 4, 2024\"}]]}]\n207:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"We announced the deprecation of the Claude 1 models. Read more in \",[\"$\",\"$Lc4\",null,{\"href\":\"/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations\",\"children\":\"Model deprecations\"}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n208:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"august-22nd-2024\",\"children\":[\"August 22, 2024\",[\"$\",\"$Lc6\",null,{\"id\":\"august-22nd-2024\",\"name\":\"August 22, 2024\"}]]}]\n209:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"We’ve added support for usage of the SDK in browsers by returning CORS headers in the API responses. Set \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"dangerouslyAllowBrowser: true\"}],\" in the SDK instantiation to enable this feature.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n20a:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"august-19th-2024\",\"children\":[\"August 19, 2024\",[\"$\",\"$Lc6\",null,{\"id\":\"august-19th-2024\",\"name\":\"August 19, 2024\"}]]}]\n20b:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"